FontLog: "FONTLOG for LW90+AAoACgAA-LW90 is a typeface that has been designed for use in titles and specialized+AAoA-graphic design. This version has limited support for Latin scripts and+AAoA-numberical glyphs, as well as basic punctuation.+AAoACgAA-If you modify this font, you are strongly encouraged to update this+AAoA-FONTLOG. Also, get in touch! I'd love to see what you're doing.+AAoACgAK-ChangeLog+AAoACgAA-13 April 2021 (Owen Q) LW90 v0.1+AAoA-- initial release+AAoACgAA-14 April 2021 (Owen Q) LW90 v0.2+AAoA-- rounded points to integers for cleaner rendering+AAoACgAK-Acknowledgements+AAoACgAA-If you modify this font, be sure to include your alias, contact information, +AAoA-and a description of your modifications. +AAoACgAA-Owen Q. (Doggybag)+AAoA-itsdoggybag@gmail.com+AAoA-https://doggybag.xyz/+AAoA-Designed the original Roman glyphs"
